    <h1 class="!font-serif !text-3xl !text-[var(--color-heading)]">Telfer's Cows</h1>
    <p class="!text-[var(--color-ink-light)] !mt-1">A Scottish Border Ballad</p>
    <p class="!text-sm !text-[var(--color-ink-light)] !mt-1">Performed by <a href="https://andrewcalhoun.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Andrew Calhoun</a></p>
  </header>

  <div class="bg-[var(--color-surface)] border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded-lg p-4 mb-8 text-center">
    <p class="!mb-1 !text-sm !text-[var(--color-ink-light)]">🎵 Listen to Andrew Calhoun's recording</p>
    <p class="!text-xs !text-[var(--color-ink-light)]">
      <a href="https://andrewcalhoun.bandcamp.com/track/telfers-cows" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="!text-[var(--color-highlight)]">Stream or buy on Bandcamp</a>
